68", "personaname": "Excalionar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/excalionar/", "num_games_owned": 133, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 22330, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19089, "last_played": 1775269106, "avatar": "4ab3db0761bdfb0b02c32de00e0924e1270cf81a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Clankers gonna clank", "timestamp_created": 1771717422, "timestamp_updated": 1771717422, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218908244", "author": {"steamid": "76561199163427931", "personaname": "Em0jeman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199163427931/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2645, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2043, "last_played": 1772238158, "avatar": "af1cf9cf15be50bc6eda5a5c35bb1698bbf77ecd"}, "language": "english", "review": " Honestly, I never played an extraction shooter this consistently before I was introduced to Arc Raiders. The whole game loop and idea of a PvPvE with aggro-based matchmaking is just genius by the devs in my opinion. The only thing that I would say is a bit annoying is how in the matchmaking, even just dealing damage to a player will put you up in a bracket in PvP wise. So if there's someone who just decides to crack and shoot you in a PvE lobby, you have to choose between either shooting back to running in hopes you lose them. And at that point, you minus well drop your loot and pull your draws down because there's no way you are making out by running. Trust me, I've tried.", "timestamp_created": 1771717137, "timestamp_updated": 1771717137, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218907921", "author": {"steamid": "76561198202108922", "personaname": "jacobsmith.ps", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198202108922/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 86927, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3313, "playtime_at_review": 40726, "last_played": 1789096167, "avatar": "d1c68323e48d80e5ba3d2eb75b0c79b1c7d9f00a"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game had problems, full of ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥. But there is a smaller sub group of PVE that is cool.", "timestamp_created": 1771716806, "timestamp_updated": 1776028092, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218907604", "author": {"steamid": "76561198851084131", "personaname": "SCP-297", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198851084131/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 8594, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1445, "last_played": 1785894649, "avatar": "01f9715a528c883711a71b0cb0f25ea911c5fb66"}, "language": "english", "review": "game", "timestamp_created": 1771716516, "timestamp_updated": 1771716516, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218907565", "author": {"steamid": "76561199173769068", "personaname": "xxkingbutter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199173769068/", "num_games_owned": 61, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 14098, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3834, "last_played": 1786610669, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1771716481, "timestamp_updated": 1771716481, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218907560", "author": {"steamid": "76561198128938285", "personaname": "Martyni", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198128938285/", "num_games_owned": 293, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 7583, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6590, "last_played": 1786135307, "avatar": "0f25f48af990cbc1e0f5ef80f6441887b6ea18de"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is the peak of extraction shooters, one run you can go in guns blazing to catch a fight every 5 seconds and next minute you can chant with your fellow randoms about blueprints. The variety of guns and equipment is amazing, allowing you to play what you want (albeit a meta for sure exists) and they all for the most part feel great to use.\n\nVery fun solo and with friends depending on how you feel, with multiple things to work towards and do. The varying modifiers keep the maps feel refreshing and the Arcs constantly pose a challenge if ignored.\n\nHighly recommend if you are into extraction shooters and even if not, it has a great PvPvE element and fun progression which allows for many shenanigans and hijinks to ensue. Some times the game can feel frustrating depending if you have a streak of bad runs, but don't let that stop you as that's just the essence of the game.\n", "timestamp_created": 1771716477, "timestamp_updated": 1771716477, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218907451", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000407990", "personaname": "Lord Parhan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198000407990/", "num_games_owned": 101, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 9843, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1976, "last_played": 1775953331, "avatar": "b4dacf84d43c07f56a51fd32627b5f6af09f51b5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Incredibly fun", "timestamp_created": 1771716357, "timestamp_updated": 1771716357, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218907428", "author": {"steamid": "76561198089105523", "personaname": "Estio", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198089105523/", "num_games_owned": 13, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 5045, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 523, "last_played": 1781736104, "avatar": "c36ccda5f22e111193a0e783af90c3254d570f67"}, "language": "english", "review": "its just perfect...", "timestamp_created": 1771716340, "timestamp_updated": 1771716340, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": fa